OL,3,GNEWSATable tennis centre reopens after
OL,4,Atornado damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA table tennis centre has reopened
OL,7,Fthree years after it was damaged by a
OL,8,Fpowerful storm and tornado.
OL,10,FStorm Ciaran and its 100mph (160km/h)
OL,11,Fwinds ripped through Jersey in November
OL,12,F2023 with the Geoff Reed Table Tennis
OL,13,FCentre being at the heart of the
OL,14,Ftornado's path.
OL,16,FEleni Middleton, president of the Table
OL,17,FTennis Association, who helped reopen
OL,18,Fthe centre, said: "Everyone's really
OL,19,Fhappy, everyone's smiling, really
OL,20,Fexcited. Finally we're back.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
