OL,3,GNEWSATable tennis centre reopens after
OL,4,Atornado damage
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's been really tough at times, but
OL,7,Fit's been really rewarding as well to
OL,8,Fsee the table tennis community come
OL,9,Ftogether in some really challenging
OL,10,Ftimes. We've all learned so much about
OL,11,Fbeing resilient, but also how to cope
OL,12,Fin adverse conditions."
